#. module: analytic_enterprise
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_analytic_enterprise
msgid ""
"\n"
"Module for defining analytic accounting object.\n"
"===============================================\n"
"\n"
"In Odoo, analytic accounts are linked to general accounts but are treated\n"
"totally independently. So, you can enter various different analytic "
"operations\n"
"that have no counterpart in the general financial accounts.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Módulo para definir objetos de contabilidad analítica.\n"
"===============================================\n"
"\n"
"En Odoo, las cuentas analíticas están vinculadas a las cuentas generales, "
"pero se tratan\n"
"de forma totalmente independiente. Por lo tanto, puedes registrar varias "
"operaciones analíticas\n"
"distintas que no tienen una contraparte en las cuentas financieras "
"generales.\n"

